window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/courses/b257-11fb863d231838cf.json"]={sha256:"11fb863d231838cf536b9b8f409205d7fd653c80fc88e90fb27890994819dba4",value:{"id":"b257","title":"水力模型縮尺試驗","titleEn":"Scale-model testing of hydraulic structures","category":"water","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"本課以非扭曲自由水面重力模型為主軸，逐步推導幾何、速度、流量、時間、壓力與合力比例，再檢查雷諾數、韋伯數及量測誤差無法自動相似的部分。十個單元要求先說明研究目的與控制尺度，再判斷哪些結果可量化放大，哪些只能定性比較，避免以模型照片漂亮取代實驗驗證。","summaryEn":"An undistorted gravity-driven free-surface model provides the main thread. Units derive geometry, velocity, discharge, time, pressure and force scales, then examine Reynolds and Weber mismatches and measurement uncertainty. Apprentices define the question and controlling length before deciding which results support quantitative extrapolation and which allow only qualitative comparison.","scope":"依公開工程原理、官方資料與規範架構編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是設計圖說、施工計畫、開挖、注漿或受限空間作業許可，也不是任何專案的設計文件。數值均為教學假設或公開資料，實際工程須由合格技師依規範與實測資料重新計算並簽證。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public engineering principles, official sources and code frameworks. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not design drawings, method statements, excavation, grouting or confined-space permits, or any project's design documents. Numbers are teaching assumptions or public data; real work must be recalculated and certified by qualified engineers using codes and measured data.","subcategory":"water-hydraulics","subcategoryTitle":"壩工監測、溢洪與壓力水路","subcategoryTitleEn":"Dam monitoring, spillways and pressure waterways","learningTrack":"water","learningSubdiscipline":"water-hydraulics","learningTags":["water","water-hydraulics","water"],"architectureFamily":"water-hydraulic","architectureNodes":[["幾何比例與控制長度","Geometry ratio and reference length"],["總流量縮尺次方","Total-discharge scale exponent"],["壓力尺度與氣泡","Pressure scale and air effects"],["韋伯數與表面張力","Weber number and surface tension"],["重複試驗與代表性","Replicates and representativeness"]],"architectureEdges":[[0,1],[1,2],[2,3],[3,4],[4,1]],"diagram":{"type":"water-hydraulic","labels":["幾何比例與控制長度","總流量縮尺次方","壓力尺度與氣泡","韋伯數與表面張力","重複試驗與代表性"],"labelsEn":["Geometry ratio and reference length","Total-discharge scale exponent","Pressure scale and air effects","Weber number and surface tension","Replicates and representativeness"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"原創縮尺敏感度：原型總流量1000m³/s，長度比例40，依佛祿相似Qm=1000/40^(5/2)=0.09882m³/s。若為節省實驗空間把比例增加10%至44，原型保持不變，所需模型流量降為1000/44^(5/2)=0.07787m³/s，約減少21.20%，並不是只減少10%。此時模型尺度更小，黏滯和表面張力相對影響反而更值得查核。學徒應重算速度、時間、感測器量程與誤差放大，確認試驗台是否能穩定提供較小流量。不能只因用水減少就認為改尺度必然改善研究品質。","textEn":"Original scale sensitivity: a prototype discharge of1000m³/s with length ratio40 requires Qm=1000/40^(5/2)=0.09882m³/s under Froude similarity. Increasing the ratio by10% to44 to save laboratory space while retaining the same prototype reduces flow to1000/44^(5/2)=0.07787m³/s, about21.20% rather than10%. The smaller model makes relative viscous and capillary effects more important to check. Recalculate velocity, timing, sensor range and uncertainty amplification, then verify that the rig can reliably provide the lower discharge. Reduced water demand alone does not establish that the revised scale improves the quality of the experiment.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表任何專案的設計值、量測值或規範允許值；改變系統邊界或荷載組合後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not any project's design values, measurements or code allowances; recalculate after changing the system boundary or load combination.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與工程背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and project context, not these numbers."},"depth":5,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":15,"enrichmentVersion":15,"stages":[{"id":"b257-v15-s1","title":"水文條件、邊界與工程系統","titleEn":"Hydrology, boundaries and engineering system","description":"本階段聚焦「幾何比例與控制長度」與「重力流速度比例」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Geometry ratio and reference length\" and \"Velocity scaling for gravity flow\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b257-v15-01","title":"幾何比例與控制長度：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Geometry ratio and reference length: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「幾何比例與控制長度」如何影響水力模型縮尺試驗的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Geometry ratio and reference length” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Scale-model testing of hydraulic structures”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"縮尺試驗先決定要研究的水理現象，再選控制長度及完整幾何範圍，不能只把外觀縮小就認為等價。非扭曲模型各方向採同一比例，局部粗糙、縫隙與邊界若無法製作應記錄；改用垂直水平不同比例時，速度與輸砂關係必須重新推導。 假設原型與模型長度比λL=40，原型水深8m及長80m，模型分別0.20m與2m；所有方向採同一比例。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「幾何比例與控制長度」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A model starts with the physical question, reference length and geometric domain rather than visual miniaturization. An undistorted model uses one ratio in all directions, documenting roughness, gaps or boundaries that cannot be reproduced. Different vertical and horizontal scales require rederived velocity and sediment relationships, so they cannot be introduced quietly while retaining undistorted-model formulas. Assume prototype-to-model length ratio40. Prototype depth8m and length80m become0.20m and2m, with the same ratio in every direction. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Geometry ratio and reference length” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設，非操作設定。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings.","failure":"常見誤解：「只要模型外觀像原型就可以忽略局部縫隙與尺度方向差異。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Visual similarity alone permits ignoring gaps and differences between horizontal and vertical scales.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「幾何比例與控制長度」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Geometry ratio and reference length”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b257-v15-01-k1","title":"幾何比例與控制長度","titleEn":"Geometry ratio and reference length","text":"縮尺試驗先決定要研究的水理現象，再選控制長度及完整幾何範圍，不能只把外觀縮小就認為等價。非扭曲模型各方向採同一比例，局部粗糙、縫隙與邊界若無法製作應記錄；改用垂直水平不同比例時，速度與輸砂關係必須重新推導。","textEn":"A model starts with the physical question, reference length and geometric domain rather than visual miniaturization. An undistorted model uses one ratio in all directions, documenting roughness, gaps or boundaries that cannot be reproduced.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]},{"id":"b257-v15-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：只要模型外觀像原型就可以忽略局部縫隙與尺度方向差異。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Visual similarity alone permits ignoring gaps and differences between horizontal and vertical scales. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「幾何比例與控制長度」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Geometry ratio and reference length\" is correct?","options":["只要模型外觀像原型就可以忽略局部縫隙與尺度方向差異。","縮尺試驗先決定要研究的水理現象，再選控制長度及完整幾何範圍，不能只把外觀縮小就認為等價。","佛祿相似要求速度與模型長度使用完全相同的縮小倍數。"],"optionsEn":["Visual similarity alone permits ignoring gaps and differences between horizontal and vertical scales.","A model starts with the physical question, reference length and geometric domain rather than visual miniaturization.","Froude similarity requires velocity to use exactly the same reduction factor as length."],"answer":1,"explanation":"縮尺試驗先決定要研究的水理現象，再選控制長度及完整幾何範圍，不能只把外觀縮小就認為等價。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A model starts with the physical question, reference length and geometric domain rather than visual miniaturization. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"b257-v15-02","title":"幾何比例與控制長度：定量估算","titleEn":"Geometry ratio and reference length: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"],"prerequisiteIds":["b257-v15-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「幾何比例與控制長度」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Geometry ratio and reference length” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設，非操作設定。假設原型與模型長度比λL=40，原型水深8m及長80m，模型分別0.20m與2m；所有方向採同一比例。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Assume prototype-to-model length ratio40. Prototype depth8m and length80m become0.20m and2m, with the same ratio in every direction. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：把原型及模型坐標、邊界和粗糙尺寸列成對照表，實測關鍵斷面而非只看製圖尺寸。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Tabulate prototype and model coordinates, boundaries and roughness, measuring critical sections rather than relying only on drawings.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b257-v15-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設，非操作設定。假設原型與模型長度比λL=40，原型水深8m及長80m，模型分別0.20m與2m；所有方向採同一比例。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Assume prototype-to-model length ratio40. Prototype depth8m and length80m become0.20m and2m, with the same ratio in every direction.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]},{"id":"b257-v15-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「幾何比例與控制長度」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Geometry ratio and reference length\", which statement holds?","options":["只要事後修改時間軸就能補救試驗時未縮尺的閥門動作。","縮尺合力只需要跟長度成正比而不必考慮受壓面積。","原創教學假設，非操作設定。"],"optionsEn":["Rescaling the recorded time axis repairs any valve motion that was not correctly scaled during the test.","Model force scales only linearly with length and does not depend on loaded area.","Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings."],"answer":2,"explanation":"原創教學假設，非操作設定。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"b257-v15-03","title":"幾何比例與控制長度：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Geometry ratio and reference length: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"],"prerequisiteIds":["b257-v15-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「幾何比例與控制長度」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Geometry ratio and reference length” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"把原型及模型坐標、邊界和粗糙尺寸列成對照表，實測關鍵斷面而非只看製圖尺寸。確認是否有扭曲尺度，將無法按比例製作的縫隙獨立標出，說明可能影響哪一項觀察量。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Tabulate prototype and model coordinates, boundaries and roughness, measuring critical sections rather than relying only on drawings. Identify any distorted scale and separately mark gaps that cannot be reproduced, explaining which observed quantities their mismatch could influence. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：把原型及模型坐標、邊界和粗糙尺寸列成對照表，實測關鍵斷面而非只看製圖尺寸。確認是否有扭曲尺度，將無法按比例製作的縫隙獨立標出，說明可能影響哪一項觀察量。","observationEn":"Site practice: Tabulate prototype and model coordinates, boundaries and roughness, measuring critical sections rather than relying only on drawings. Identify any distorted scale and separately mark gaps that cannot be reproduced, explaining which observed quantities their mismatch could influence.","failure":"注意干擾：微小閘縫若在模型被封死會改變漏流，轉角磨圓則可能改變分離。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Closing a tiny modeled gate gap changes leakage, while rounded corners alter separation. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b257-v15-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"把原型及模型坐標、邊界和粗糙尺寸列成對照表，實測關鍵斷面而非只看製圖尺寸。確認是否有扭曲尺度，將無法按比例製作的縫隙獨立標出，說明可能影響哪一項觀察量。","textEn":"Tabulate prototype and model coordinates, boundaries and roughness, measuring critical sections rather than relying only on drawings. Identify any distorted scale and separately mark gaps that cannot be reproduced, explaining which observed quantities their mismatch could influence.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]},{"id":"b257-v15-03-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"把原型及模型坐標、邊界和粗糙尺寸列成對照表，實測關鍵斷面而非只看製圖尺寸。確認是否有扭曲尺度，將無法按比例製作的縫隙獨立標出，說明可能影響哪一項觀察量。","textEn":"Tabulate prototype and model coordinates, boundaries and roughness, measuring critical sections rather than relying only on drawings. Identify any distorted scale and separately mark gaps that cannot be reproduced, explaining which observed quantities their mismatch could influence.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「幾何比例與控制長度」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Geometry ratio and reference length\"?","options":["把原型及模型坐標、邊界和粗糙尺寸列成對照表，實測關鍵斷面而非只看製圖尺寸。","量測時不必記錄溫度、水頭、水位歷程與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","重力相似已經自動保證液滴尺寸與曝氣程度都能直接放大。"],"optionsEn":["Tabulate prototype and model coordinates, boundaries and roughness, measuring critical sections rather than relying only on drawings.","Temperature, water head, water-level history and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Gravity similarity automatically makes droplet size and air entrainment directly scalable."],"answer":0,"explanation":"把原型及模型坐標、邊界和粗糙尺寸列成對照表，實測關鍵斷面而非只看製圖尺寸。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Tabulate prototype and model coordinates, boundaries and roughness, measuring critical sections rather than relying only on drawings. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"b257-v15-04","title":"幾何比例與控制長度：失效診斷","titleEn":"Geometry ratio and reference length: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"],"prerequisiteIds":["b257-v15-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「幾何比例與控制長度」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Geometry ratio and reference length” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"微小閘縫若在模型被封死會改變漏流，轉角磨圓則可能改變分離。外觀相似但垂直尺度偷偷不同時，原本的相似律不再適用，結果仍可能看起來很合理。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Closing a tiny modeled gate gap changes leakage, while rounded corners alter separation. A visually similar model with an undisclosed vertical-scale change violates the original similarity assumptions even when its output appears plausible. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設原型與模型長度比λL=40，原型水深8m及長80m，模型分別0.20m與2m；所有方向採同一比例。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Prototype depth8m and length80m become0.20m and2m, with the same ratio in every direction.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「只要模型外觀像原型就可以忽略局部縫隙與尺度方向差異。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Visual similarity alone permits ignoring gaps and differences between horizontal and vertical scales.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b257-v15-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"微小閘縫若在模型被封死會改變漏流，轉角磨圓則可能改變分離。外觀相似但垂直尺度偷偷不同時，原本的相似律不再適用，結果仍可能看起來很合理。","textEn":"Closing a tiny modeled gate gap changes leakage, while rounded corners alter separation. A visually similar model with an undisclosed vertical-scale change violates the original similarity assumptions even when its output appears plausible.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]},{"id":"b257-v15-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「幾何比例與控制長度」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Geometry ratio and reference length\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","微小閘縫若在模型被封死會改變漏流，轉角磨圓則可能改變分離。","佛祿相似要求速度與模型長度使用完全相同的縮小倍數。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","Closing a tiny modeled gate gap changes leakage, while rounded corners alter separation.","Froude similarity requires velocity to use exactly the same reduction factor as length."],"answer":1,"explanation":"微小閘縫若在模型被封死會改變漏流，轉角磨圓則可能改變分離。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Closing a tiny modeled gate gap changes leakage, while rounded corners alter separation. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"b257-v15-05","title":"重力流速度比例：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Velocity scaling for gravity flow: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"],"prerequisiteIds":["b257-v15-04"],"objective":"說明「重力流速度比例」如何影響水力模型縮尺試驗的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Velocity scaling for gravity flow” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Scale-model testing of hydraulic structures”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"自由水面重力主導時以佛祿數相等建立速度比例，必須確認原型與模型使用相同重力場。此時速度不是隨長度線性縮小，且黏滯或表面張力主導的小尺度區仍可能失真；同一速度比例也不能無條件套到加壓水錘或可壓縮氣流。 假設λL=40且佛祿相似，原型速度8m/s，模型Vm=8/√40=1.2649m/s；不保證雷諾相似。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「重力流速度比例」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"For gravity-dominated free surfaces, equal Froude numbers determine velocity scaling under equal gravity. Velocity does not shrink linearly with length, and small viscous or capillary regions may remain distorted. The same relation cannot automatically describe pressurized water hammer or compressible air, whose controlling physics and required similarity parameters differ from the chosen free-surface experiment. Assume length ratio40 and Froude similarity. Prototype velocity8m/s gives Vm=8/√40=1.2649m/s, without guaranteeing Reynolds similarity. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Velocity scaling for gravity flow” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設，非操作設定。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings.","failure":"常見誤解：「佛祿相似要求速度與模型長度使用完全相同的縮小倍數。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Froude similarity requires velocity to use exactly the same reduction factor as length.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「重力流速度比例」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Velocity scaling for gravity flow”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b257-v15-05-k1","title":"重力流速度比例","titleEn":"Velocity scaling for gravity flow","text":"自由水面重力主導時以佛祿數相等建立速度比例，必須確認原型與模型使用相同重力場。此時速度不是隨長度線性縮小，且黏滯或表面張力主導的小尺度區仍可能失真；同一速度比例也不能無條件套到加壓水錘或可壓縮氣流。","textEn":"For gravity-dominated free surfaces, equal Froude numbers determine velocity scaling under equal gravity. Velocity does not shrink linearly with length, and small viscous or capillary regions may remain distorted.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]},{"id":"b257-v15-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：佛祿相似要求速度與模型長度使用完全相同的縮小倍數。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Froude similarity requires velocity to use exactly the same reduction factor as length. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「重力流速度比例」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Velocity scaling for gravity flow\" is correct?","options":["佛祿相似要求速度與模型長度使用完全相同的縮小倍數。","總流量與每米寬度流量在縮尺模型都使用同一比例次方。","自由水面重力主導時以佛祿數相等建立速度比例，必須確認原型與模型使用相同重力場。"],"optionsEn":["Froude similarity requires velocity to use exactly the same reduction factor as length.","Total discharge and discharge per unit width use the same scaling exponent.","For gravity-dominated free surfaces, equal Froude numbers determine velocity scaling under equal gravity."],"answer":2,"explanation":"自由水面重力主導時以佛祿數相等建立速度比例，必須確認原型與模型使用相同重力場。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"For gravity-dominated free surfaces, equal Froude numbers determine velocity scaling under equal gravity. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"b257-v15-06","title":"重力流速度比例：定量估算","titleEn":"Velocity scaling for gravity flow: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"],"prerequisiteIds":["b257-v15-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「重力流速度比例」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Velocity scaling for gravity flow” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設，非操作設定。假設λL=40且佛祿相似，原型速度8m/s，模型Vm=8/√40=1.2649m/s；不保證雷諾相似。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Assume length ratio40 and Froude similarity. Prototype velocity8m/s gives Vm=8/√40=1.2649m/s, without guaranteeing Reynolds similarity. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：分別用原型與模型水深計算佛祿數，查核速度量測位置是否對應。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Compute Froude numbers independently using corresponding depths and velocity locations.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b257-v15-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設，非操作設定。假設λL=40且佛祿相似，原型速度8m/s，模型Vm=8/√40=1.2649m/s；不保證雷諾相似。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Assume length ratio40 and Froude similarity. Prototype velocity8m/s gives Vm=8/√40=1.2649m/s, without guaranteeing Reynolds similarity.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]},{"id":"b257-v15-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「重力流速度比例」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Velocity scaling for gravity flow\", which statement holds?","options":["原創教學假設，非操作設定。","重力壓力比例正確就表示空化與封閉氣泡壓縮也完全相似。","模型主流雷諾數高就可以證明每個細縫和近壁區都與原型相似。"],"optionsEn":["Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings.","Correct gravity-pressure scaling proves that cavitation and trapped-air compression are also fully similar.","A high main-flow Reynolds number proves similarity in every small gap and near-wall region."],"answer":0,"explanation":"原創教學假設，非操作設定。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"b257-v15-07","title":"重力流速度比例：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Velocity scaling for gravity flow: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"],"prerequisiteIds":["b257-v15-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「重力流速度比例」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Velocity scaling for gravity flow” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"分別用原型與模型水深計算佛祿數，查核速度量測位置是否對應。再估黏滯與表面張力影響範圍，區分局部薄水層和主要流區，不以整體相似掩蓋小尺度區域的失真。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Compute Froude numbers independently using corresponding depths and velocity locations. Estimate where viscosity and surface tension matter, separating thin local layers from the main flow rather than hiding small-scale distortion behind a matching global similarity parameter. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：分別用原型與模型水深計算佛祿數，查核速度量測位置是否對應。再估黏滯與表面張力影響範圍，區分局部薄水層和主要流區，不以整體相似掩蓋小尺度區域的失真。","observationEn":"Site practice: Compute Froude numbers independently using corresponding depths and velocity locations. Estimate where viscosity and surface tension matter, separating thin local layers from the main flow rather than hiding small-scale distortion behind a matching global similarity parameter.","failure":"注意干擾：將速度也縮小四十倍會使流態和波速錯位，僅調整入流直到外觀看似相同也可能改變水深。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Reducing velocity fortyfold misrepresents flow regime and wave propagation, while adjusting inflow merely to match appearance may change depth. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b257-v15-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"分別用原型與模型水深計算佛祿數，查核速度量測位置是否對應。再估黏滯與表面張力影響範圍，區分局部薄水層和主要流區，不以整體相似掩蓋小尺度區域的失真。","textEn":"Compute Froude numbers independently using corresponding depths and velocity locations. Estimate where viscosity and surface tension matter, separating thin local layers from the main flow rather than hiding small-scale distortion behind a matching global similarity parameter.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]},{"id":"b257-v15-07-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"分別用原型與模型水深計算佛祿數，查核速度量測位置是否對應。再估黏滯與表面張力影響範圍，區分局部薄水層和主要流區，不以整體相似掩蓋小尺度區域的失真。","textEn":"Compute Froude numbers independently using corresponding depths and velocity locations. Estimate where viscosity and surface tension matter, separating thin local layers from the main flow rather than hiding small-scale distortion behind a matching global similarity parameter.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「重力流速度比例」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Velocity scaling for gravity flow\"?","options":["沿用另一處水工設施或流域的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","分別用原型與模型水深計算佛祿數，查核速度量測位置是否對應。","模型讀值誤差很小所以換算回原型後可以完全忽略不計。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another hydraulic structure or catchment counts as verifying this structure.","Compute Froude numbers independently using corresponding depths and velocity locations.","A small model reading error can be ignored completely after conversion to prototype scale."],"answer":1,"explanation":"分別用原型與模型水深計算佛祿數，查核速度量測位置是否對應。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Compute Froude numbers independently using corresponding depths and velocity locations. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"b257-v15-08","title":"重力流速度比例：失效診斷","titleEn":"Velocity scaling for gravity flow: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"],"prerequisiteIds":["b257-v15-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「重力流速度比例」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Velocity scaling for gravity flow” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"將速度也縮小四十倍會使流態和波速錯位，僅調整入流直到外觀看似相同也可能改變水深。局部黏性控制區即使佛祿數正確，壓力和渦流仍未必可直接放大。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Reducing velocity fortyfold misrepresents flow regime and wave propagation, while adjusting inflow merely to match appearance may change depth. Locally viscous regions can still have unrepresentative pressures and vortices despite equal Froude numbers. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設λL=40且佛祿相似，原型速度8m/s，模型Vm=8/√40=1.2649m/s；不保證雷諾相似。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Prototype velocity8m/s gives Vm=8/√40=1.2649m/s, without guaranteeing Reynolds similarity.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「佛祿相似要求速度與模型長度使用完全相同的縮小倍數。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Froude similarity requires velocity to use exactly the same reduction factor as length.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b257-v15-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"將速度也縮小四十倍會使流態和波速錯位，僅調整入流直到外觀看似相同也可能改變水深。局部黏性控制區即使佛祿數正確，壓力和渦流仍未必可直接放大。","textEn":"Reducing velocity fortyfold misrepresents flow regime and wave propagation, while adjusting inflow merely to match appearance may change depth. Locally viscous regions can still have unrepresentative pressures and vortices despite equal Froude numbers.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]},{"id":"b257-v15-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「重力流速度比例」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Velocity scaling for gravity flow\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","總流量與每米寬度流量在縮尺模型都使用同一比例次方。","將速度也縮小四十倍會使流態和波速錯位，僅調整入流直到外觀看似相同也可能改變水深。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","Total discharge and discharge per unit width use the same scaling exponent.","Reducing velocity fortyfold misrepresents flow regime and wave propagation, while adjusting inflow merely to match appearance may change depth."],"answer":2,"explanation":"將速度也縮小四十倍會使流態和波速錯位，僅調整入流直到外觀看似相同也可能改變水深。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Reducing velocity fortyfold misrepresents flow regime and wave propagation, while adjusting inflow merely to match appearance may change depth. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"b257-v15-s2","title":"水力機制、材料與定量模型","titleEn":"Hydraulics, materials and quantitative models","description":"本階段聚焦「總流量縮尺次方」與「時間縮尺與記錄」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Total-discharge scale exponent\" and \"Time scaling and recording\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b257-v15-09","title":"總流量縮尺次方：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Total-discharge scale exponent: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"],"prerequisiteIds":["b257-v15-08"],"objective":"說明「總流量縮尺次方」如何影響水力模型縮尺試驗的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Total-discharge scale exponent” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Scale-model testing of hydraulic structures”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"總流量是斷面面積乘速度，非扭曲重力模型的面積按長度平方、速度按平方根縮放，因此總流量有不同次方。單位寬度流量另有分母，兩者不能混用；量測管路與模型入口也需一致，旁通或溢流未記錄會破壞整體收支。 假設λL=40、原型總Q=1000m³/s，模型Qm=Qp/λL^(5/2)=0.09882m³/s；不是單位寬度流量比例。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「總流量縮尺次方」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Total discharge combines cross-sectional area with velocity. An undistorted gravity model scales area with length squared and velocity with its square root, producing a distinct exponent. Unit-width discharge has a different denominator and cannot use the same rule. Measurement piping, bypasses and overflow must also match the model boundary to preserve the water balance. Assume length ratio40 and prototype total discharge1000m³/s. Model Qm=Qp/λL^(5/2)=0.09882m³/s, distinct from unit-width discharge scaling. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Total-discharge scale exponent” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設，非操作設定。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings.","failure":"常見誤解：「總流量與每米寬度流量在縮尺模型都使用同一比例次方。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Total discharge and discharge per unit width use the same scaling exponent.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「總流量縮尺次方」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Total-discharge scale exponent”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b257-v15-09-k1","title":"總流量縮尺次方","titleEn":"Total-discharge scale exponent","text":"總流量是斷面面積乘速度，非扭曲重力模型的面積按長度平方、速度按平方根縮放，因此總流量有不同次方。單位寬度流量另有分母，兩者不能混用；量測管路與模型入口也需一致，旁通或溢流未記錄會破壞整體收支。","textEn":"Total discharge combines cross-sectional area with velocity. An undistorted gravity model scales area with length squared and velocity with its square root, producing a distinct exponent.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]},{"id":"b257-v15-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：總流量與每米寬度流量在縮尺模型都使用同一比例次方。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Total discharge and discharge per unit width use the same scaling exponent. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「總流量縮尺次方」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Total-discharge scale exponent\" is correct?","options":["總流量是斷面面積乘速度，非扭曲重力模型的面積按長度平方、速度按平方根縮放，因此總流量有不同次方。","總流量與每米寬度流量在縮尺模型都使用同一比例次方。","只要事後修改時間軸就能補救試驗時未縮尺的閥門動作。"],"optionsEn":["Total discharge combines cross-sectional area with velocity.","Total discharge and discharge per unit width use the same scaling exponent.","Rescaling the recorded time axis repairs any valve motion that was not correctly scaled during the test."],"answer":0,"explanation":"總流量是斷面面積乘速度，非扭曲重力模型的面積按長度平方、速度按平方根縮放，因此總流量有不同次方。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Total discharge combines cross-sectional area with velocity. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"b257-v15-10","title":"總流量縮尺次方：定量估算","titleEn":"Total-discharge scale exponent: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"],"prerequisiteIds":["b257-v15-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「總流量縮尺次方」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Total-discharge scale exponent” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設，非操作設定。假設λL=40、原型總Q=1000m³/s，模型Qm=Qp/λL^(5/2)=0.09882m³/s；不是單位寬度流量比例。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Assume length ratio40 and prototype total discharge1000m³/s. Model Qm=Qp/λL^(5/2)=0.09882m³/s, distinct from unit-width discharge scaling. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：從面積與速度比例逐步推導流量次方，確認資料標示總流量或每米寬度。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Derive the exponent from area and velocity and label total versus per-width discharge.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b257-v15-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設，非操作設定。假設λL=40、原型總Q=1000m³/s，模型Qm=Qp/λL^(5/2)=0.09882m³/s；不是單位寬度流量比例。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Assume length ratio40 and prototype total discharge1000m³/s. Model Qm=Qp/λL^(5/2)=0.09882m³/s, distinct from unit-width discharge scaling.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]},{"id":"b257-v15-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「總流量縮尺次方」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Total-discharge scale exponent\", which statement holds?","options":["縮尺合力只需要跟長度成正比而不必考慮受壓面積。","原創教學假設，非操作設定。","重力相似已經自動保證液滴尺寸與曝氣程度都能直接放大。"],"optionsEn":["Model force scales only linearly with length and does not depend on loaded area.","Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings.","Gravity similarity automatically makes droplet size and air entrainment directly scalable."],"answer":1,"explanation":"原創教學假設，非操作設定。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"b257-v15-11","title":"總流量縮尺次方：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Total-discharge scale exponent: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"],"prerequisiteIds":["b257-v15-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「總流量縮尺次方」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Total-discharge scale exponent” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"從面積與速度比例逐步推導流量次方，確認資料標示總流量或每米寬度。以獨立容積時間法查核流量計，記錄旁通與回流，並將校正範圍對照實際模型所需的小流量。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Derive the exponent from area and velocity and label total versus per-width discharge. Check the flow meter independently by volume and time, recording bypass and recirculation and comparing its calibration range with the small discharge actually required by the model. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：從面積與速度比例逐步推導流量次方，確認資料標示總流量或每米寬度。以獨立容積時間法查核流量計，記錄旁通與回流，並將校正範圍對照實際模型所需的小流量。","observationEn":"Site practice: Derive the exponent from area and velocity and label total versus per-width discharge. Check the flow meter independently by volume and time, recording bypass and recirculation and comparing its calibration range with the small discharge actually required by the model.","failure":"注意干擾：把每米流量的次方用在總流量會差一個長度比例，低流量儀器超出校正範圍又會加深誤差。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Using the unit-width exponent for total discharge introduces an entire length-scale error, compounded if the meter operates outside calibration. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b257-v15-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"從面積與速度比例逐步推導流量次方，確認資料標示總流量或每米寬度。以獨立容積時間法查核流量計，記錄旁通與回流，並將校正範圍對照實際模型所需的小流量。","textEn":"Derive the exponent from area and velocity and label total versus per-width discharge. Check the flow meter independently by volume and time, recording bypass and recirculation and comparing its calibration range with the small discharge actually required by the model.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]},{"id":"b257-v15-11-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"從面積與速度比例逐步推導流量次方，確認資料標示總流量或每米寬度。以獨立容積時間法查核流量計，記錄旁通與回流，並將校正範圍對照實際模型所需的小流量。","textEn":"Derive the exponent from area and velocity and label total versus per-width discharge. Check the flow meter independently by volume and time, recording bypass and recirculation and comparing its calibration range with the small discharge actually required by the model.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「總流量縮尺次方」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Total-discharge scale exponent\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","重複三次結果很接近就代表所有未測工況與系統偏差都已驗證。","從面積與速度比例逐步推導流量次方，確認資料標示總流量或每米寬度。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","Three closely agreeing repeats validate every untested condition and eliminate systematic bias.","Derive the exponent from area and velocity and label total versus per-width discharge."],"answer":2,"explanation":"從面積與速度比例逐步推導流量次方，確認資料標示總流量或每米寬度。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Derive the exponent from area and velocity and label total versus per-width discharge. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"b257-v15-12","title":"總流量縮尺次方：失效診斷","titleEn":"Total-discharge scale exponent: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"],"prerequisiteIds":["b257-v15-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「總流量縮尺次方」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Total-discharge scale exponent” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"把每米流量的次方用在總流量會差一個長度比例，低流量儀器超出校正範圍又會加深誤差。水面看似接近時，仍可能因錯誤流量造成錯誤能量與消能判讀。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Using the unit-width exponent for total discharge introduces an entire length-scale error, compounded if the meter operates outside calibration. Similar-looking water levels can still conceal incorrect energy and dissipation because the delivered discharge is wrong. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設λL=40、原型總Q=1000m³/s，模型Qm=Qp/λL^(5/2)=0.09882m³/s；不是單位寬度流量比例。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Model Qm=Qp/λL^(5/2)=0.09882m³/s, distinct from unit-width discharge scaling.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「總流量與每米寬度流量在縮尺模型都使用同一比例次方。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Total discharge and discharge per unit width use the same scaling exponent.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b257-v15-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"把每米流量的次方用在總流量會差一個長度比例，低流量儀器超出校正範圍又會加深誤差。水面看似接近時，仍可能因錯誤流量造成錯誤能量與消能判讀。","textEn":"Using the unit-width exponent for total discharge introduces an entire length-scale error, compounded if the meter operates outside calibration. Similar-looking water levels can still conceal incorrect energy and dissipation because the delivered discharge is wrong.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]},{"id":"b257-v15-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「總流量縮尺次方」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Total-discharge scale exponent\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["把每米流量的次方用在總流量會差一個長度比例，低流量儀器超出校正範圍又會加深誤差。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","只要事後修改時間軸就能補救試驗時未縮尺的閥門動作。"],"optionsEn":["Using the unit-width exponent for total discharge introduces an entire length-scale error, compounded if the meter operates outside calibration.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","Rescaling the recorded time axis repairs any valve motion that was not correctly scaled during the test."],"answer":0,"explanation":"把每米流量的次方用在總流量會差一個長度比例，低流量儀器超出校正範圍又會加深誤差。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Using the unit-width exponent for total discharge introduces an entire length-scale error, compounded if the meter operates outside calibration. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"b257-v15-13","title":"時間縮尺與記錄：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Time scaling and recording: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"],"prerequisiteIds":["b257-v15-12"],"objective":"說明「時間縮尺與記錄」如何影響水力模型縮尺試驗的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Time scaling and recording” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Scale-model testing of hydraulic structures”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"重力模型的時間比例由長度除速度得到，原型漫長變化會在模型較短時間內發生。儀器取樣率、閥門運動與入流變化需同步配合，不能只縮放最後結果而保留原型的操作時間；資料對齊也應記錄起始事件，避免把時間偏移誤認為物理遲滯。 假設λL=40，原型事件120s，模型時間tm=120/√40=18.974s；只適用所選重力相似過程。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「時間縮尺與記錄」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Gravity-model time follows length divided by velocity, compressing long prototype changes into shorter experiments. Sampling, actuator movement and inflow variation must be synchronized accordingly, rather than scaling outputs while retaining prototype operating duration. Records also require a defined start event so clock offsets are not mistaken for physical lag in the measured hydraulic response. Assume length ratio40 and prototype duration120s. Model tm=120/√40=18.974s, applying only to the selected gravity-similar process. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Time scaling and recording” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設，非操作設定。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings.","failure":"常見誤解：「只要事後修改時間軸就能補救試驗時未縮尺的閥門動作。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Rescaling the recorded time axis repairs any valve motion that was not correctly scaled during the test.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「時間縮尺與記錄」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Time scaling and recording”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b257-v15-13-k1","title":"時間縮尺與記錄","titleEn":"Time scaling and recording","text":"重力模型的時間比例由長度除速度得到，原型漫長變化會在模型較短時間內發生。儀器取樣率、閥門運動與入流變化需同步配合，不能只縮放最後結果而保留原型的操作時間；資料對齊也應記錄起始事件，避免把時間偏移誤認為物理遲滯。","textEn":"Gravity-model time follows length divided by velocity, compressing long prototype changes into shorter experiments. Sampling, actuator movement and inflow variation must be synchronized accordingly, rather than scaling outputs while retaining prototype operating duration.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]},{"id":"b257-v15-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：只要事後修改時間軸就能補救試驗時未縮尺的閥門動作。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Rescaling the recorded time axis repairs any valve motion that was not correctly scaled during the test. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「時間縮尺與記錄」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Time scaling and recording\" is correct?","options":["只要事後修改時間軸就能補救試驗時未縮尺的閥門動作。","重力模型的時間比例由長度除速度得到，原型漫長變化會在模型較短時間內發生。","重力壓力比例正確就表示空化與封閉氣泡壓縮也完全相似。"],"optionsEn":["Rescaling the recorded time axis repairs any valve motion that was not correctly scaled during the test.","Gravity-model time follows length divided by velocity, compressing long prototype changes into shorter experiments.","Correct gravity-pressure scaling proves that cavitation and trapped-air compression are also fully similar."],"answer":1,"explanation":"重力模型的時間比例由長度除速度得到，原型漫長變化會在模型較短時間內發生。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Gravity-model time follows length divided by velocity, compressing long prototype changes into shorter experiments. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"b257-v15-14","title":"時間縮尺與記錄：定量估算","titleEn":"Time scaling and recording: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"],"prerequisiteIds":["b257-v15-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「時間縮尺與記錄」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Time scaling and recording” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設，非操作設定。假設λL=40，原型事件120s，模型時間tm=120/√40=18.974s；只適用所選重力相似過程。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Assume length ratio40 and prototype duration120s. Model tm=120/√40=18.974s, applying only to the selected gravity-similar process. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：把入流、閥位與量測通道放在共同時間軸，明列原型與模型的換算。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Align inflow, valve position and sensor channels on a common clock and document both time scales.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b257-v15-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設，非操作設定。假設λL=40，原型事件120s，模型時間tm=120/√40=18.974s；只適用所選重力相似過程。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Assume length ratio40 and prototype duration120s. Model tm=120/√40=18.974s, applying only to the selected gravity-similar process.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]},{"id":"b257-v15-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「時間縮尺與記錄」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Time scaling and recording\", which statement holds?","options":["模型主流雷諾數高就可以證明每個細縫和近壁區都與原型相似。","模型讀值誤差很小所以換算回原型後可以完全忽略不計。","原創教學假設，非操作設定。"],"optionsEn":["A high main-flow Reynolds number proves similarity in every small gap and near-wall region.","A small model reading error can be ignored completely after conversion to prototype scale.","Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings."],"answer":2,"explanation":"原創教學假設，非操作設定。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"b257-v15-15","title":"時間縮尺與記錄：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Time scaling and recording: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"],"prerequisiteIds":["b257-v15-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「時間縮尺與記錄」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Time scaling and recording” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"把入流、閥位與量測通道放在共同時間軸，明列原型與模型的換算。以可辨識水波事件校核時鐘和觸發延遲，檢查最快變化是否仍有足夠資料，不讓儀器更新頻率主導試驗結果。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Align inflow, valve position and sensor channels on a common clock and document both time scales. Check triggers against an identifiable wave event and verify resolution of the fastest changes so instrument refresh limits do not govern the apparent experimental response. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：把入流、閥位與量測通道放在共同時間軸，明列原型與模型的換算。以可辨識水波事件校核時鐘和觸發延遲，檢查最快變化是否仍有足夠資料，不讓儀器更新頻率主導試驗結果。","observationEn":"Site practice: Align inflow, valve position and sensor channels on a common clock and document both time scales. Check triggers against an identifiable wave event and verify resolution of the fastest changes so instrument refresh limits do not govern the apparent experimental response.","failure":"注意干擾：閥門動作沒有縮時會讓模型充水過慢，取樣頻率不足又會漏掉短峰值。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: An unscaled actuator duration makes filling too slow, and sparse sampling misses short peaks. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b257-v15-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"把入流、閥位與量測通道放在共同時間軸，明列原型與模型的換算。以可辨識水波事件校核時鐘和觸發延遲，檢查最快變化是否仍有足夠資料，不讓儀器更新頻率主導試驗結果。","textEn":"Align inflow, valve position and sensor channels on a common clock and document both time scales. Check triggers against an identifiable wave event and verify resolution of the fastest changes so instrument refresh limits do not govern the apparent experimental response.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]},{"id":"b257-v15-15-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"把入流、閥位與量測通道放在共同時間軸，明列原型與模型的換算。以可辨識水波事件校核時鐘和觸發延遲，檢查最快變化是否仍有足夠資料，不讓儀器更新頻率主導試驗結果。","textEn":"Align inflow, valve position and sensor channels on a common clock and document both time scales. Check triggers against an identifiable wave event and verify resolution of the fastest changes so instrument refresh limits do not govern the apparent experimental response.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「時間縮尺與記錄」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Time scaling and recording\"?","options":["把入流、閥位與量測通道放在共同時間軸，明列原型與模型的換算。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","只要模型外觀像原型就可以忽略局部縫隙與尺度方向差異。"],"optionsEn":["Align inflow, valve position and sensor channels on a common clock and document both time scales.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","Visual similarity alone permits ignoring gaps and differences between horizontal and vertical scales."],"answer":0,"explanation":"把入流、閥位與量測通道放在共同時間軸，明列原型與模型的換算。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Align inflow, valve position and sensor channels on a common clock and document both time scales. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"b257-v15-16","title":"時間縮尺與記錄：失效診斷","titleEn":"Time scaling and recording: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"],"prerequisiteIds":["b257-v15-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「時間縮尺與記錄」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Time scaling and recording” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"閥門動作沒有縮時會讓模型充水過慢，取樣頻率不足又會漏掉短峰值。事後把時間軸乘比例，不能補回試驗當時沒有正確重現的邊界變化。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"An unscaled actuator duration makes filling too slow, and sparse sampling misses short peaks. Multiplying the time axis afterward cannot restore boundary changes that were not correctly reproduced while the physical experiment was running. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設λL=40，原型事件120s，模型時間tm=120/√40=18.974s；只適用所選重力相似過程。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Model tm=120/√40=18.974s, applying only to the selected gravity-similar process.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「只要事後修改時間軸就能補救試驗時未縮尺的閥門動作。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Rescaling the recorded time axis repairs any valve motion that was not correctly scaled during the test.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b257-v15-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"閥門動作沒有縮時會讓模型充水過慢，取樣頻率不足又會漏掉短峰值。事後把時間軸乘比例，不能補回試驗當時沒有正確重現的邊界變化。","textEn":"An unscaled actuator duration makes filling too slow, and sparse sampling misses short peaks. Multiplying the time axis afterward cannot restore boundary changes that were not correctly reproduced while the physical experiment was running.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]},{"id":"b257-v15-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「時間縮尺與記錄」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Time scaling and recording\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","閥門動作沒有縮時會讓模型充水過慢，取樣頻率不足又會漏掉短峰值。","重力壓力比例正確就表示空化與封閉氣泡壓縮也完全相似。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","An unscaled actuator duration makes filling too slow, and sparse sampling misses short peaks.","Correct gravity-pressure scaling proves that cavitation and trapped-air compression are also fully similar."],"answer":1,"explanation":"閥門動作沒有縮時會讓模型充水過慢，取樣頻率不足又會漏掉短峰值。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"An unscaled actuator duration makes filling too slow, and sparse sampling misses short peaks. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"b257-v15-s3","title":"施工方法與施工階段控制","titleEn":"Construction methods and stage control","description":"本階段聚焦「壓力尺度與氣泡」與「合力尺度與量測」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Pressure scale and air effects\" and \"Force scaling and measurement\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b257-v15-17","title":"壓力尺度與氣泡：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Pressure scale and air effects: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"],"prerequisiteIds":["b257-v15-16"],"objective":"說明「壓力尺度與氣泡」如何影響水力模型縮尺試驗的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Pressure scale and air effects” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Scale-model testing of hydraulic structures”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"相同液體密度與重力下，重力壓力尺度隨長度比例改變，但絕對氣壓不會自動跟著縮小。模型氣泡、負壓和空化可能因此偏離原型，尤其局部高速與衝擊區；靜水或重力動壓的可放大性不能被解釋成所有瞬態壓力都相似。 假設λL=40、同密度重力壓力原型60kPa，模型壓力1.50kPa；此為表壓重力尺度，不代表絕對氣壓也縮四十倍。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「壓力尺度與氣泡」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"At matched liquid density and gravity, gravity-pressure scale follows length, but ambient absolute pressure does not automatically scale. Air bubbles, suction and cavitation can therefore differ from the prototype, especially in high-speed or impact regions. Scaling hydrostatic or gravity-dominated pressure does not establish similarity of every transient pressure mechanism within the same apparatus. Assume length ratio40 and matched density. Prototype gravity gauge pressure60kPa scales to1.50kPa, without scaling ambient absolute air pressure fortyfold. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Pressure scale and air effects” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設，非操作設定。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings.","failure":"常見誤解：「重力壓力比例正確就表示空化與封閉氣泡壓縮也完全相似。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Correct gravity-pressure scaling proves that cavitation and trapped-air compression are also fully similar.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「壓力尺度與氣泡」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Pressure scale and air effects”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b257-v15-17-k1","title":"壓力尺度與氣泡","titleEn":"Pressure scale and air effects","text":"相同液體密度與重力下，重力壓力尺度隨長度比例改變，但絕對氣壓不會自動跟著縮小。模型氣泡、負壓和空化可能因此偏離原型，尤其局部高速與衝擊區；靜水或重力動壓的可放大性不能被解釋成所有瞬態壓力都相似。","textEn":"At matched liquid density and gravity, gravity-pressure scale follows length, but ambient absolute pressure does not automatically scale. Air bubbles, suction and cavitation can therefore differ from the prototype, especially in high-speed or impact regions.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]},{"id":"b257-v15-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：重力壓力比例正確就表示空化與封閉氣泡壓縮也完全相似。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Correct gravity-pressure scaling proves that cavitation and trapped-air compression are also fully similar. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「壓力尺度與氣泡」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Pressure scale and air effects\" is correct?","options":["重力壓力比例正確就表示空化與封閉氣泡壓縮也完全相似。","縮尺合力只需要跟長度成正比而不必考慮受壓面積。","相同液體密度與重力下，重力壓力尺度隨長度比例改變，但絕對氣壓不會自動跟著縮小。"],"optionsEn":["Correct gravity-pressure scaling proves that cavitation and trapped-air compression are also fully similar.","Model force scales only linearly with length and does not depend on loaded area.","At matched liquid density and gravity, gravity-pressure scale follows length, but ambient absolute pressure does not automatically scale."],"answer":2,"explanation":"相同液體密度與重力下，重力壓力尺度隨長度比例改變，但絕對氣壓不會自動跟著縮小。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"At matched liquid density and gravity, gravity-pressure scale follows length, but ambient absolute pressure does not automatically scale. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"b257-v15-18","title":"壓力尺度與氣泡：定量估算","titleEn":"Pressure scale and air effects: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"],"prerequisiteIds":["b257-v15-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「壓力尺度與氣泡」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Pressure scale and air effects” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設，非操作設定。假設λL=40、同密度重力壓力原型60kPa，模型壓力1.50kPa；此為表壓重力尺度，不代表絕對氣壓也縮四十倍。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Assume length ratio40 and matched density. Prototype gravity gauge pressure60kPa scales to1.50kPa, without scaling ambient absolute air pressure fortyfold. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：記錄壓力是表壓或絕對壓力並核對零點，區分慢變重力壓與短時衝擊。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Label gauge versus absolute pressure and verify zero, separating slow gravity loading from brief impact.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b257-v15-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設，非操作設定。假設λL=40、同密度重力壓力原型60kPa，模型壓力1.50kPa；此為表壓重力尺度，不代表絕對氣壓也縮四十倍。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Assume length ratio40 and matched density. Prototype gravity gauge pressure60kPa scales to1.50kPa, without scaling ambient absolute air pressure fortyfold.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]},{"id":"b257-v15-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「壓力尺度與氣泡」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Pressure scale and air effects\", which statement holds?","options":["原創教學假設，非操作設定。","重力相似已經自動保證液滴尺寸與曝氣程度都能直接放大。","重複三次結果很接近就代表所有未測工況與系統偏差都已驗證。"],"optionsEn":["Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings.","Gravity similarity automatically makes droplet size and air entrainment directly scalable.","Three closely agreeing repeats validate every untested condition and eliminate systematic bias."],"answer":0,"explanation":"原創教學假設，非操作設定。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"b257-v15-19","title":"壓力尺度與氣泡：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Pressure scale and air effects: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"],"prerequisiteIds":["b257-v15-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「壓力尺度與氣泡」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Pressure scale and air effects” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"記錄壓力是表壓或絕對壓力並核對零點，區分慢變重力壓與短時衝擊。觀察氣泡和通氣路徑，將空化相關區域單獨標註，必要時以不同尺度或專門裝置檢驗未相似的機制。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Label gauge versus absolute pressure and verify zero, separating slow gravity loading from brief impact. Observe bubbles and ventilation paths, flag cavitation-sensitive regions and use alternative scales or specialized facilities where needed to examine mechanisms not represented by the chosen similitude. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：記錄壓力是表壓或絕對壓力並核對零點，區分慢變重力壓與短時衝擊。觀察氣泡和通氣路徑，將空化相關區域單獨標註，必要時以不同尺度或專門裝置檢驗未相似的機制。","observationEn":"Site practice: Label gauge versus absolute pressure and verify zero, separating slow gravity loading from brief impact. Observe bubbles and ventilation paths, flag cavitation-sensitive regions and use alternative scales or specialized facilities where needed to examine mechanisms not represented by the chosen similitude.","failure":"注意干擾：封閉空氣團的壓縮在模型可能比原型更顯著，直接放大尖峰會誤判結構荷載。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Trapped-air compression can be disproportionately important in the model, making direct scaling of peaks misleading. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b257-v15-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"記錄壓力是表壓或絕對壓力並核對零點，區分慢變重力壓與短時衝擊。觀察氣泡和通氣路徑，將空化相關區域單獨標註，必要時以不同尺度或專門裝置檢驗未相似的機制。","textEn":"Label gauge versus absolute pressure and verify zero, separating slow gravity loading from brief impact. Observe bubbles and ventilation paths, flag cavitation-sensitive regions and use alternative scales or specialized facilities where needed to examine mechanisms not represented by the chosen similitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]},{"id":"b257-v15-19-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"記錄壓力是表壓或絕對壓力並核對零點，區分慢變重力壓與短時衝擊。觀察氣泡和通氣路徑，將空化相關區域單獨標註，必要時以不同尺度或專門裝置檢驗未相似的機制。","textEn":"Label gauge versus absolute pressure and verify zero, separating slow gravity loading from brief impact. Observe bubbles and ventilation paths, flag cavitation-sensitive regions and use alternative scales or specialized facilities where needed to examine mechanisms not represented by the chosen similitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「壓力尺度與氣泡」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Pressure scale and air effects\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","記錄壓力是表壓或絕對壓力並核對零點，區分慢變重力壓與短時衝擊。","佛祿相似要求速度與模型長度使用完全相同的縮小倍數。"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","Label gauge versus absolute pressure and verify zero, separating slow gravity loading from brief impact.","Froude similarity requires velocity to use exactly the same reduction factor as length."],"answer":1,"explanation":"記錄壓力是表壓或絕對壓力並核對零點，區分慢變重力壓與短時衝擊。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Label gauge versus absolute pressure and verify zero, separating slow gravity loading from brief impact. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"b257-v15-20","title":"壓力尺度與氣泡：失效診斷","titleEn":"Pressure scale and air effects: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"],"prerequisiteIds":["b257-v15-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「壓力尺度與氣泡」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Pressure scale and air effects” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"封閉空氣團的壓縮在模型可能比原型更顯著，直接放大尖峰會誤判結構荷載。把表壓負值當成低於蒸氣壓，亦會在沒有絕對壓力基準時錯判空化。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Trapped-air compression can be disproportionately important in the model, making direct scaling of peaks misleading. A negative gauge reading also cannot establish pressure below vapor pressure without the corresponding absolute-pressure reference. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設λL=40、同密度重力壓力原型60kPa，模型壓力1.50kPa；此為表壓重力尺度，不代表絕對氣壓也縮四十倍。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Prototype gravity gauge pressure60kPa scales to1.50kPa, without scaling ambient absolute air pressure fortyfold.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「重力壓力比例正確就表示空化與封閉氣泡壓縮也完全相似。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Correct gravity-pressure scaling proves that cavitation and trapped-air compression are also fully similar.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b257-v15-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"封閉空氣團的壓縮在模型可能比原型更顯著，直接放大尖峰會誤判結構荷載。把表壓負值當成低於蒸氣壓，亦會在沒有絕對壓力基準時錯判空化。","textEn":"Trapped-air compression can be disproportionately important in the model, making direct scaling of peaks misleading. A negative gauge reading also cannot establish pressure below vapor pressure without the corresponding absolute-pressure reference.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]},{"id":"b257-v15-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「壓力尺度與氣泡」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Pressure scale and air effects\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","縮尺合力只需要跟長度成正比而不必考慮受壓面積。","封閉空氣團的壓縮在模型可能比原型更顯著，直接放大尖峰會誤判結構荷載。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","Model force scales only linearly with length and does not depend on loaded area.","Trapped-air compression can be disproportionately important in the model, making direct scaling of peaks misleading."],"answer":2,"explanation":"封閉空氣團的壓縮在模型可能比原型更顯著，直接放大尖峰會誤判結構荷載。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Trapped-air compression can be disproportionately important in the model, making direct scaling of peaks misleading. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"b257-v15-21","title":"合力尺度與量測：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Force scaling and measurement: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"],"prerequisiteIds":["b257-v15-20"],"objective":"說明「合力尺度與量測」如何影響水力模型縮尺試驗的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Force scaling and measurement” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Scale-model testing of hydraulic structures”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"壓力積分成合力時還要乘面積，所以同密度重力模型的力比例是長度三次方。量測裝置的剛度、頻率和支架阻流可能改變原本流場，模型力很小時摩擦和纜線也可能重要；不能僅因荷重元件讀值穩定就認為力傳遞已被完整量到。 假設λL=40、原型重力主導合力2MN，模型Fm=2000000/40³=31.25N；未處理感測器動態或氣泡衝擊。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「合力尺度與量測」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Integrating pressure over area gives a cubic length scale for force under matched-density gravity similarity. Sensor stiffness, natural frequency and support blockage can alter the flow, and friction or cables become significant when model forces are small. Stable readings alone do not establish that the complete intended load path reaches the calibrated measuring device. Assume length ratio40 and prototype gravity-dominated force2MN. Model Fm=2000000/40³=31.25N, excluding sensor dynamics and air-impact scaling. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Force scaling and measurement” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設，非操作設定。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings.","failure":"常見誤解：「縮尺合力只需要跟長度成正比而不必考慮受壓面積。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Model force scales only linearly with length and does not depend on loaded area.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「合力尺度與量測」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Force scaling and measurement”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b257-v15-21-k1","title":"合力尺度與量測","titleEn":"Force scaling and measurement","text":"壓力積分成合力時還要乘面積，所以同密度重力模型的力比例是長度三次方。量測裝置的剛度、頻率和支架阻流可能改變原本流場，模型力很小時摩擦和纜線也可能重要；不能僅因荷重元件讀值穩定就認為力傳遞已被完整量到。","textEn":"Integrating pressure over area gives a cubic length scale for force under matched-density gravity similarity. Sensor stiffness, natural frequency and support blockage can alter the flow, and friction or cables become significant when model forces are small.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]},{"id":"b257-v15-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：縮尺合力只需要跟長度成正比而不必考慮受壓面積。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Model force scales only linearly with length and does not depend on loaded area. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「合力尺度與量測」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Force scaling and measurement\" is correct?","options":["壓力積分成合力時還要乘面積，所以同密度重力模型的力比例是長度三次方。","縮尺合力只需要跟長度成正比而不必考慮受壓面積。","模型主流雷諾數高就可以證明每個細縫和近壁區都與原型相似。"],"optionsEn":["Integrating pressure over area gives a cubic length scale for force under matched-density gravity similarity.","Model force scales only linearly with length and does not depend on loaded area.","A high main-flow Reynolds number proves similarity in every small gap and near-wall region."],"answer":0,"explanation":"壓力積分成合力時還要乘面積，所以同密度重力模型的力比例是長度三次方。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Integrating pressure over area gives a cubic length scale for force under matched-density gravity similarity. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"b257-v15-22","title":"合力尺度與量測：定量估算","titleEn":"Force scaling and measurement: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"],"prerequisiteIds":["b257-v15-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「合力尺度與量測」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Force scaling and measurement” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設，非操作設定。假設λL=40、原型重力主導合力2MN，模型Fm=2000000/40³=31.25N；未處理感測器動態或氣泡衝擊。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Assume length ratio40 and prototype gravity-dominated force2MN. Model Fm=2000000/40³=31.25N, excluding sensor dynamics and air-impact scaling. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：以已知方向和位置的砝碼校核整套力傳遞路徑，記錄支架自振頻率及零漂。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Calibrate the full load path using known weights and positions, recording support frequency and zero drift.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b257-v15-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設，非操作設定。假設λL=40、原型重力主導合力2MN，模型Fm=2000000/40³=31.25N；未處理感測器動態或氣泡衝擊。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Assume length ratio40 and prototype gravity-dominated force2MN. Model Fm=2000000/40³=31.25N, excluding sensor dynamics and air-impact scaling.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]},{"id":"b257-v15-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「合力尺度與量測」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Force scaling and measurement\", which statement holds?","options":["模型讀值誤差很小所以換算回原型後可以完全忽略不計。","原創教學假設，非操作設定。","只要模型外觀像原型就可以忽略局部縫隙與尺度方向差異。"],"optionsEn":["A small model reading error can be ignored completely after conversion to prototype scale.","Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings.","Visual similarity alone permits ignoring gaps and differences between horizontal and vertical scales."],"answer":1,"explanation":"原創教學假設，非操作設定。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"b257-v15-23","title":"合力尺度與量測：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Force scaling and measurement: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"],"prerequisiteIds":["b257-v15-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「合力尺度與量測」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Force scaling and measurement” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"以已知方向和位置的砝碼校核整套力傳遞路徑，記錄支架自振頻率及零漂。比較壓力積分與總力感測器結果，檢查水流是否繞過或推到未量測的支架，不只校正單顆感測元件。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Calibrate the full load path using known weights and positions, recording support frequency and zero drift. Compare integrated pressure with measured resultant and check whether water loads bypass the sensor or act on unmeasured supports rather than calibrating only the isolated transducer. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：以已知方向和位置的砝碼校核整套力傳遞路徑，記錄支架自振頻率及零漂。比較壓力積分與總力感測器結果，檢查水流是否繞過或推到未量測的支架，不只校正單顆感測元件。","observationEn":"Site practice: Calibrate the full load path using known weights and positions, recording support frequency and zero drift. Compare integrated pressure with measured resultant and check whether water loads bypass the sensor or act on unmeasured supports rather than calibrating only the isolated transducer.","failure":"注意干擾：支架摩擦可能承擔部分荷重，使感測器低估；共振則可能放大短峰值。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Support friction can carry load away from the sensor, while resonance amplifies short peaks. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b257-v15-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以已知方向和位置的砝碼校核整套力傳遞路徑，記錄支架自振頻率及零漂。比較壓力積分與總力感測器結果，檢查水流是否繞過或推到未量測的支架，不只校正單顆感測元件。","textEn":"Calibrate the full load path using known weights and positions, recording support frequency and zero drift. Compare integrated pressure with measured resultant and check whether water loads bypass the sensor or act on unmeasured supports rather than calibrating only the isolated transducer.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]},{"id":"b257-v15-23-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"以已知方向和位置的砝碼校核整套力傳遞路徑，記錄支架自振頻率及零漂。比較壓力積分與總力感測器結果，檢查水流是否繞過或推到未量測的支架，不只校正單顆感測元件。","textEn":"Calibrate the full load path using known weights and positions, recording support frequency and zero drift. Compare integrated pressure with measured resultant and check whether water loads bypass the sensor or act on unmeasured supports rather than calibrating only the isolated transducer.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「合力尺度與量測」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Force scaling and measurement\"?","options":["只要結構分析模型看起來合理，就可以省略現場量測與試驗。","總流量與每米寬度流量在縮尺模型都使用同一比例次方。","以已知方向和位置的砝碼校核整套力傳遞路徑，記錄支架自振頻率及零漂。"],"optionsEn":["If the structural model looks reasonable, site measurement and testing can be skipped.","Total discharge and discharge per unit width use the same scaling exponent.","Calibrate the full load path using known weights and positions, recording support frequency and zero drift."],"answer":2,"explanation":"以已知方向和位置的砝碼校核整套力傳遞路徑，記錄支架自振頻率及零漂。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Calibrate the full load path using known weights and positions, recording support frequency and zero drift. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"b257-v15-24","title":"合力尺度與量測：失效診斷","titleEn":"Force scaling and measurement: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"],"prerequisiteIds":["b257-v15-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「合力尺度與量測」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Force scaling and measurement” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"支架摩擦可能承擔部分荷重，使感測器低估；共振則可能放大短峰值。兩種偏差都能在靜態校正看似良好時出現，必須查核水中實際動態條件。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Support friction can carry load away from the sensor, while resonance amplifies short peaks. Both errors can occur despite satisfactory static calibration and require examination under the actual submerged dynamic conditions of the experiment. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設λL=40、原型重力主導合力2MN，模型Fm=2000000/40³=31.25N；未處理感測器動態或氣泡衝擊。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Model Fm=2000000/40³=31.25N, excluding sensor dynamics and air-impact scaling.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「縮尺合力只需要跟長度成正比而不必考慮受壓面積。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Model force scales only linearly with length and does not depend on loaded area.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b257-v15-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"支架摩擦可能承擔部分荷重，使感測器低估；共振則可能放大短峰值。兩種偏差都能在靜態校正看似良好時出現，必須查核水中實際動態條件。","textEn":"Support friction can carry load away from the sensor, while resonance amplifies short peaks. Both errors can occur despite satisfactory static calibration and require examination under the actual submerged dynamic conditions of the experiment.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]},{"id":"b257-v15-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「合力尺度與量測」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Force scaling and measurement\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["支架摩擦可能承擔部分荷重，使感測器低估；共振則可能放大短峰值。","只要結構還沒倒，就代表安全餘裕仍然足夠。","模型主流雷諾數高就可以證明每個細縫和近壁區都與原型相似。"],"optionsEn":["Support friction can carry load away from the sensor, while resonance amplifies short peaks.","As long as the structure is still standing, its safety margin must still be adequate.","A high main-flow Reynolds number proves similarity in every small gap and near-wall region."],"answer":0,"explanation":"支架摩擦可能承擔部分荷重，使感測器低估；共振則可能放大短峰值。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Support friction can carry load away from the sensor, while resonance amplifies short peaks. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"b257-v15-s4","title":"試驗、量測與監測驗證","titleEn":"Testing, measurement and monitoring","description":"本階段聚焦「雷諾數與黏滯失真」與「韋伯數與表面張力」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Reynolds number and viscous distortion\" and \"Weber number and surface tension\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b257-v15-25","title":"雷諾數與黏滯失真：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Reynolds number and viscous distortion: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"],"prerequisiteIds":["b257-v15-24"],"objective":"說明「雷諾數與黏滯失真」如何影響水力模型縮尺試驗的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Reynolds number and viscous distortion” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Scale-model testing of hydraulic structures”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"使用同一水體且採佛祿相似時，模型速度和長度都變小，雷諾數不能同時保持。主要流區可能仍是紊流，但薄水層、近壁與小縫可能受黏滯控制；不能用一個全域雷諾數宣稱所有局部現象相似，應檢查尺寸改變後結果是否穩定。 假設ν=10⁻⁶m²/s，以水深為控制長度，模型V=8/√40m/s、h=0.20m，Re≈252982；原型V=8m/s、h=8m，Re=64000000。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「雷諾數與黏滯失真」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"With the same fluid under Froude similarity, both velocity and length decrease, so Reynolds number is not preserved. Main flow may remain turbulent while thin layers, walls and gaps become viscosity-sensitive. One global Reynolds number cannot qualify every local phenomenon; comparing more than one scale helps determine whether the measured result depends on the altered viscous regime. Assumeν=10⁻⁶m²/s, using depth as the reference length. Model V=8/√40m/s,h=0.20m gives Re≈252982; prototype V=8m/s,h=8m gives Re=64000000. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Reynolds number and viscous distortion” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設，非操作設定。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings.","failure":"常見誤解：「模型主流雷諾數高就可以證明每個細縫和近壁區都與原型相似。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A high main-flow Reynolds number proves similarity in every small gap and near-wall region.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「雷諾數與黏滯失真」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Reynolds number and viscous distortion”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b257-v15-25-k1","title":"雷諾數與黏滯失真","titleEn":"Reynolds number and viscous distortion","text":"使用同一水體且採佛祿相似時，模型速度和長度都變小，雷諾數不能同時保持。主要流區可能仍是紊流，但薄水層、近壁與小縫可能受黏滯控制；不能用一個全域雷諾數宣稱所有局部現象相似，應檢查尺寸改變後結果是否穩定。","textEn":"With the same fluid under Froude similarity, both velocity and length decrease, so Reynolds number is not preserved. Main flow may remain turbulent while thin layers, walls and gaps become viscosity-sensitive.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]},{"id":"b257-v15-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：模型主流雷諾數高就可以證明每個細縫和近壁區都與原型相似。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A high main-flow Reynolds number proves similarity in every small gap and near-wall region. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「雷諾數與黏滯失真」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Reynolds number and viscous distortion\" is correct?","options":["模型主流雷諾數高就可以證明每個細縫和近壁區都與原型相似。","使用同一水體且採佛祿相似時，模型速度和長度都變小，雷諾數不能同時保持。","重力相似已經自動保證液滴尺寸與曝氣程度都能直接放大。"],"optionsEn":["A high main-flow Reynolds number proves similarity in every small gap and near-wall region.","With the same fluid under Froude similarity, both velocity and length decrease, so Reynolds number is not preserved.","Gravity similarity automatically makes droplet size and air entrainment directly scalable."],"answer":1,"explanation":"使用同一水體且採佛祿相似時，模型速度和長度都變小，雷諾數不能同時保持。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"With the same fluid under Froude similarity, both velocity and length decrease, so Reynolds number is not preserved. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"b257-v15-26","title":"雷諾數與黏滯失真：定量估算","titleEn":"Reynolds number and viscous distortion: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"],"prerequisiteIds":["b257-v15-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「雷諾數與黏滯失真」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Reynolds number and viscous distortion” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設，非操作設定。假設ν=10⁻⁶m²/s，以水深為控制長度，模型V=8/√40m/s、h=0.20m，Re≈252982；原型V=8m/s、h=8m，Re=64000000。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Assumeν=10⁻⁶m²/s, using depth as the reference length. Model V=8/√40m/s,h=0.20m gives Re≈252982; prototype V=8m/s,h=8m gives Re=64000000. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：用真正控制局部現象的長度估雷諾數，記錄水溫對黏度的影響，不能只選最大池寬。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Estimate Reynolds number using lengths controlling the local mechanism and record temperature-dependent viscosity rather than automatically choosing maximum basin width.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b257-v15-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設，非操作設定。假設ν=10⁻⁶m²/s，以水深為控制長度，模型V=8/√40m/s、h=0.20m，Re≈252982；原型V=8m/s、h=8m，Re=64000000。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Assumeν=10⁻⁶m²/s, using depth as the reference length. Model V=8/√40m/s,h=0.20m gives Re≈252982; prototype V=8m/s,h=8m gives Re=64000000.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]},{"id":"b257-v15-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「雷諾數與黏滯失真」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Reynolds number and viscous distortion\", which statement holds?","options":["重複三次結果很接近就代表所有未測工況與系統偏差都已驗證。","佛祿相似要求速度與模型長度使用完全相同的縮小倍數。","原創教學假設，非操作設定。"],"optionsEn":["Three closely agreeing repeats validate every untested condition and eliminate systematic bias.","Froude similarity requires velocity to use exactly the same reduction factor as length.","Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings."],"answer":2,"explanation":"原創教學假設，非操作設定。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"b257-v15-27","title":"雷諾數與黏滯失真：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Reynolds number and viscous distortion: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"],"prerequisiteIds":["b257-v15-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「雷諾數與黏滯失真」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Reynolds number and viscous distortion” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"用真正控制局部現象的長度估雷諾數，記錄水溫對黏度的影響，不能只選最大池寬。比較至少兩尺度的壓損、分離或薄層行為，保留不能可靠外推的區域與觀察量。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Estimate Reynolds number using lengths controlling the local mechanism and record temperature-dependent viscosity rather than automatically choosing maximum basin width. Compare losses, separation or thin layers at multiple scales and retain explicit limits for quantities that cannot be reliably extrapolated. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：用真正控制局部現象的長度估雷諾數，記錄水溫對黏度的影響，不能只選最大池寬。比較至少兩尺度的壓損、分離或薄層行為，保留不能可靠外推的區域與觀察量。","observationEn":"Site practice: Estimate Reynolds number using lengths controlling the local mechanism and record temperature-dependent viscosity rather than automatically choosing maximum basin width. Compare losses, separation or thin layers at multiple scales and retain explicit limits for quantities that cannot be reliably extrapolated.","failure":"注意干擾：大水槽的全域雷諾數很高仍可能有層流閘縫，若把局部漏流按紊流比例放大，會算錯。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: A high basin-scale Reynolds number can coexist with a laminar gate gap, invalidating turbulent leakage scaling. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b257-v15-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"用真正控制局部現象的長度估雷諾數，記錄水溫對黏度的影響，不能只選最大池寬。比較至少兩尺度的壓損、分離或薄層行為，保留不能可靠外推的區域與觀察量。","textEn":"Estimate Reynolds number using lengths controlling the local mechanism and record temperature-dependent viscosity rather than automatically choosing maximum basin width. Compare losses, separation or thin layers at multiple scales and retain explicit limits for quantities that cannot be reliably extrapolated.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]},{"id":"b257-v15-27-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"用真正控制局部現象的長度估雷諾數，記錄水溫對黏度的影響，不能只選最大池寬。比較至少兩尺度的壓損、分離或薄層行為，保留不能可靠外推的區域與觀察量。","textEn":"Estimate Reynolds number using lengths controlling the local mechanism and record temperature-dependent viscosity rather than automatically choosing maximum basin width. Compare losses, separation or thin layers at multiple scales and retain explicit limits for quantities that cannot be reliably extrapolated.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「雷諾數與黏滯失真」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Reynolds number and viscous distortion\"?","options":["用真正控制局部現象的長度估雷諾數，記錄水溫對黏度的影響，不能只選最大池寬。","量測時不必記錄溫度、水頭、水位歷程與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","只要事後修改時間軸就能補救試驗時未縮尺的閥門動作。"],"optionsEn":["Estimate Reynolds number using lengths controlling the local mechanism and record temperature-dependent viscosity rather than automatically choosing maximum basin width.","Temperature, water head, water-level history and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Rescaling the recorded time axis repairs any valve motion that was not correctly scaled during the test."],"answer":0,"explanation":"用真正控制局部現象的長度估雷諾數，記錄水溫對黏度的影響，不能只選最大池寬。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Estimate Reynolds number using lengths controlling the local mechanism and record temperature-dependent viscosity rather than automatically choosing maximum basin width. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"b257-v15-28","title":"雷諾數與黏滯失真：失效診斷","titleEn":"Reynolds number and viscous distortion: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"],"prerequisiteIds":["b257-v15-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「雷諾數與黏滯失真」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Reynolds number and viscous distortion” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"大水槽的全域雷諾數很高仍可能有層流閘縫，若把局部漏流按紊流比例放大，會算錯。溫度變化又可能在同一模型內改變黏度，使重複試驗不完全可比。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"A high basin-scale Reynolds number can coexist with a laminar gate gap, invalidating turbulent leakage scaling. Water-temperature changes also alter viscosity between repeated tests, so nominally identical geometry and discharge need not give directly comparable local behavior. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設ν=10⁻⁶m²/s，以水深為控制長度，模型V=8/√40m/s、h=0.20m，Re≈252982；原型V=8m/s、h=8m，Re=64000000。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Model V=8/√40m/s,h=0.20m gives Re≈252982; prototype V=8m/s,h=8m gives Re=64000000.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「模型主流雷諾數高就可以證明每個細縫和近壁區都與原型相似。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A high main-flow Reynolds number proves similarity in every small gap and near-wall region.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b257-v15-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"大水槽的全域雷諾數很高仍可能有層流閘縫，若把局部漏流按紊流比例放大，會算錯。溫度變化又可能在同一模型內改變黏度，使重複試驗不完全可比。","textEn":"A high basin-scale Reynolds number can coexist with a laminar gate gap, invalidating turbulent leakage scaling. Water-temperature changes also alter viscosity between repeated tests, so nominally identical geometry and discharge need not give directly comparable local behavior.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]},{"id":"b257-v15-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「雷諾數與黏滯失真」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Reynolds number and viscous distortion\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","大水槽的全域雷諾數很高仍可能有層流閘縫，若把局部漏流按紊流比例放大，會算錯。","重力相似已經自動保證液滴尺寸與曝氣程度都能直接放大。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","A high basin-scale Reynolds number can coexist with a laminar gate gap, invalidating turbulent leakage scaling.","Gravity similarity automatically makes droplet size and air entrainment directly scalable."],"answer":1,"explanation":"大水槽的全域雷諾數很高仍可能有層流閘縫，若把局部漏流按紊流比例放大，會算錯。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A high basin-scale Reynolds number can coexist with a laminar gate gap, invalidating turbulent leakage scaling. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"b257-v15-29","title":"韋伯數與表面張力：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Weber number and surface tension: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"],"prerequisiteIds":["b257-v15-28"],"objective":"說明「韋伯數與表面張力」如何影響水力模型縮尺試驗的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Weber number and surface tension” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Scale-model testing of hydraulic structures”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"表面張力對小尺度水舌、液滴與薄膜相對重要，重力縮尺通常不會保留慣性與表面張力之比。模型看見的破碎、噴濺或氣泡大小可能因此失真，不能以外觀照片當定量證據；若研究問題正是這些現象，需要另選尺度或承認觀察僅能定性。 假設ρ=1000kg/m³、σ=0.072N/m、模型V²=1.6m²/s²、L=0.20m，We=ρV²L/σ=4444.4；原型值是其1600倍。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「韋伯數與表面張力」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Surface tension matters disproportionately for small jets, drops and films, and gravity scaling generally does not preserve its ratio to inertia. Breakup, spray and bubble size can therefore be distorted, making photographs insufficient quantitative evidence. If these phenomena are the study objective, a different scale or explicit qualitative limitation is needed rather than assuming visual similarity guarantees the physics. Assumeρ=1000kg/m³,σ=0.072N/m,model V²=1.6m²/s² and L=0.20m. We=4444.4; the corresponding prototype value is1600times larger. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Weber number and surface tension” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設，非操作設定。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings.","failure":"常見誤解：「重力相似已經自動保證液滴尺寸與曝氣程度都能直接放大。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Gravity similarity automatically makes droplet size and air entrainment directly scalable.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「韋伯數與表面張力」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Weber number and surface tension”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b257-v15-29-k1","title":"韋伯數與表面張力","titleEn":"Weber number and surface tension","text":"表面張力對小尺度水舌、液滴與薄膜相對重要，重力縮尺通常不會保留慣性與表面張力之比。模型看見的破碎、噴濺或氣泡大小可能因此失真，不能以外觀照片當定量證據；若研究問題正是這些現象，需要另選尺度或承認觀察僅能定性。","textEn":"Surface tension matters disproportionately for small jets, drops and films, and gravity scaling generally does not preserve its ratio to inertia. Breakup, spray and bubble size can therefore be distorted, making photographs insufficient quantitative evidence.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]},{"id":"b257-v15-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：重力相似已經自動保證液滴尺寸與曝氣程度都能直接放大。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Gravity similarity automatically makes droplet size and air entrainment directly scalable. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「韋伯數與表面張力」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Weber number and surface tension\" is correct?","options":["重力相似已經自動保證液滴尺寸與曝氣程度都能直接放大。","模型讀值誤差很小所以換算回原型後可以完全忽略不計。","表面張力對小尺度水舌、液滴與薄膜相對重要，重力縮尺通常不會保留慣性與表面張力之比。"],"optionsEn":["Gravity similarity automatically makes droplet size and air entrainment directly scalable.","A small model reading error can be ignored completely after conversion to prototype scale.","Surface tension matters disproportionately for small jets, drops and films, and gravity scaling generally does not preserve its ratio to inertia."],"answer":2,"explanation":"表面張力對小尺度水舌、液滴與薄膜相對重要，重力縮尺通常不會保留慣性與表面張力之比。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Surface tension matters disproportionately for small jets, drops and films, and gravity scaling generally does not preserve its ratio to inertia. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"b257-v15-30","title":"韋伯數與表面張力：定量估算","titleEn":"Weber number and surface tension: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"],"prerequisiteIds":["b257-v15-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「韋伯數與表面張力」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Weber number and surface tension” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設，非操作設定。假設ρ=1000kg/m³、σ=0.072N/m、模型V²=1.6m²/s²、L=0.20m，We=ρV²L/σ=4444.4；原型值是其1600倍。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Assumeρ=1000kg/m³,σ=0.072N/m,model V²=1.6m²/s² and L=0.20m. We=4444.4; the corresponding prototype value is1600times larger. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：先指定表面張力影響的局部長度，記錄水質、溫度及表面污染，查核材料是否改變潤濕。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Define the local length relevant to surface tension and record temperature, water condition and contamination, checking altered wetting on model materials.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b257-v15-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設，非操作設定。假設ρ=1000kg/m³、σ=0.072N/m、模型V²=1.6m²/s²、L=0.20m，We=ρV²L/σ=4444.4；原型值是其1600倍。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Assumeρ=1000kg/m³,σ=0.072N/m,model V²=1.6m²/s² and L=0.20m. We=4444.4; the corresponding prototype value is1600times larger.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]},{"id":"b257-v15-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「韋伯數與表面張力」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Weber number and surface tension\", which statement holds?","options":["原創教學假設，非操作設定。","只要模型外觀像原型就可以忽略局部縫隙與尺度方向差異。","總流量與每米寬度流量在縮尺模型都使用同一比例次方。"],"optionsEn":["Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings.","Visual similarity alone permits ignoring gaps and differences between horizontal and vertical scales.","Total discharge and discharge per unit width use the same scaling exponent."],"answer":0,"explanation":"原創教學假設，非操作設定。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"b257-v15-31","title":"韋伯數與表面張力：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Weber number and surface tension: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"],"prerequisiteIds":["b257-v15-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「韋伯數與表面張力」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Weber number and surface tension” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"先指定表面張力影響的局部長度，記錄水質、溫度及表面污染，查核材料是否改變潤濕。比較不同尺度水舌破裂和噴濺，將可量化水位與只宜定性解讀的液滴外觀分開。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Define the local length relevant to surface tension and record temperature, water condition and contamination, checking altered wetting on model materials. Compare jet breakup and spray across scales, separating quantitatively useful levels from droplet appearances that support only qualitative interpretation. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：先指定表面張力影響的局部長度，記錄水質、溫度及表面污染，查核材料是否改變潤濕。比較不同尺度水舌破裂和噴濺，將可量化水位與只宜定性解讀的液滴外觀分開。","observationEn":"Site practice: Define the local length relevant to surface tension and record temperature, water condition and contamination, checking altered wetting on model materials. Compare jet breakup and spray across scales, separating quantitatively useful levels from droplet appearances that support only qualitative interpretation.","failure":"注意干擾：模型小液滴可能被表面張力束縛，原型卻更易破碎，直接按照片估曝氣會偏差。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Small model droplets can remain surface-tension-bound where prototype flow breaks up, biasing air-entrainment estimates from imagery. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b257-v15-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"先指定表面張力影響的局部長度，記錄水質、溫度及表面污染，查核材料是否改變潤濕。比較不同尺度水舌破裂和噴濺，將可量化水位與只宜定性解讀的液滴外觀分開。","textEn":"Define the local length relevant to surface tension and record temperature, water condition and contamination, checking altered wetting on model materials. Compare jet breakup and spray across scales, separating quantitatively useful levels from droplet appearances that support only qualitative interpretation.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]},{"id":"b257-v15-31-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"先指定表面張力影響的局部長度，記錄水質、溫度及表面污染，查核材料是否改變潤濕。比較不同尺度水舌破裂和噴濺，將可量化水位與只宜定性解讀的液滴外觀分開。","textEn":"Define the local length relevant to surface tension and record temperature, water condition and contamination, checking altered wetting on model materials. Compare jet breakup and spray across scales, separating quantitatively useful levels from droplet appearances that support only qualitative interpretation.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「韋伯數與表面張力」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Weber number and surface tension\"?","options":["沿用另一處水工設施或流域的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","先指定表面張力影響的局部長度，記錄水質、溫度及表面污染，查核材料是否改變潤濕。","重力壓力比例正確就表示空化與封閉氣泡壓縮也完全相似。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another hydraulic structure or catchment counts as verifying this structure.","Define the local length relevant to surface tension and record temperature, water condition and contamination, checking altered wetting on model materials.","Correct gravity-pressure scaling proves that cavitation and trapped-air compression are also fully similar."],"answer":1,"explanation":"先指定表面張力影響的局部長度，記錄水質、溫度及表面污染，查核材料是否改變潤濕。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Define the local length relevant to surface tension and record temperature, water condition and contamination, checking altered wetting on model materials. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"b257-v15-32","title":"韋伯數與表面張力：失效診斷","titleEn":"Weber number and surface tension: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"],"prerequisiteIds":["b257-v15-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「韋伯數與表面張力」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Weber number and surface tension” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"模型小液滴可能被表面張力束縛，原型卻更易破碎，直接按照片估曝氣會偏差。加入界面活性物質改變張力時，也可能連帶改變氣泡與量測條件，不能當簡單修補。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Small model droplets can remain surface-tension-bound where prototype flow breaks up, biasing air-entrainment estimates from imagery. Surfactant adjustments also change bubbles and measurement conditions and cannot be treated as an uncomplicated correction to all scale effects. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設ρ=1000kg/m³、σ=0.072N/m、模型V²=1.6m²/s²、L=0.20m，We=ρV²L/σ=4444.4；原型值是其1600倍。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: We=4444.4; the corresponding prototype value is1600times larger.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「重力相似已經自動保證液滴尺寸與曝氣程度都能直接放大。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Gravity similarity automatically makes droplet size and air entrainment directly scalable.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b257-v15-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"模型小液滴可能被表面張力束縛，原型卻更易破碎，直接按照片估曝氣會偏差。加入界面活性物質改變張力時，也可能連帶改變氣泡與量測條件，不能當簡單修補。","textEn":"Small model droplets can remain surface-tension-bound where prototype flow breaks up, biasing air-entrainment estimates from imagery. Surfactant adjustments also change bubbles and measurement conditions and cannot be treated as an uncomplicated correction to all scale effects.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]},{"id":"b257-v15-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「韋伯數與表面張力」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Weber number and surface tension\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","模型讀值誤差很小所以換算回原型後可以完全忽略不計。","模型小液滴可能被表面張力束縛，原型卻更易破碎，直接按照片估曝氣會偏差。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","A small model reading error can be ignored completely after conversion to prototype scale.","Small model droplets can remain surface-tension-bound where prototype flow breaks up, biasing air-entrainment estimates from imagery."],"answer":2,"explanation":"模型小液滴可能被表面張力束縛，原型卻更易破碎，直接按照片估曝氣會偏差。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Small model droplets can remain surface-tension-bound where prototype flow breaks up, biasing air-entrainment estimates from imagery. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4},{"id":"b257-v15-s5","title":"耐久、維護與工程交接","titleEn":"Durability, maintenance and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「讀值誤差的放大」與「重複試驗與代表性」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Scaling measurement uncertainty\" and \"Replicates and representativeness\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b257-v15-33","title":"讀值誤差的放大：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Scaling measurement uncertainty: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"],"prerequisiteIds":["b257-v15-32"],"objective":"說明「讀值誤差的放大」如何影響水力模型縮尺試驗的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Scaling measurement uncertainty” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Scale-model testing of hydraulic structures”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"模型的微小讀值誤差放回原型後也按相應比例放大，不能以數字小就忽略。讀值重複性、共同零點及尺度製造誤差屬不同分量，必須說明相關性後再合成；原型結果的小數位應反映證據，而不是把模型儀器的每一位都乘出來展示。 假設模型水位標準不確定度0.0005m、λL=40且比例視為精確，原型相應標準不確定度0.020m；未含尺度本身誤差。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「讀值誤差的放大」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Small model reading errors grow under prototype scaling and cannot be dismissed by their absolute size. Repeatability, coherent zero offset and fabrication-scale error are distinct components requiring stated correlations before combination. Reported prototype precision should follow the evidence, not every digit produced by multiplying an instrument display by the geometric ratio in a spreadsheet. Assume model level standard uncertainty0.0005m and exact length ratio40. Prototype-equivalent uncertainty is0.020m, excluding uncertainty in the scale itself. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Scaling measurement uncertainty” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設，非操作設定。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings.","failure":"常見誤解：「模型讀值誤差很小所以換算回原型後可以完全忽略不計。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A small model reading error can be ignored completely after conversion to prototype scale.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「讀值誤差的放大」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Scaling measurement uncertainty”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b257-v15-33-k1","title":"讀值誤差的放大","titleEn":"Scaling measurement uncertainty","text":"模型的微小讀值誤差放回原型後也按相應比例放大，不能以數字小就忽略。讀值重複性、共同零點及尺度製造誤差屬不同分量，必須說明相關性後再合成；原型結果的小數位應反映證據，而不是把模型儀器的每一位都乘出來展示。","textEn":"Small model reading errors grow under prototype scaling and cannot be dismissed by their absolute size. Repeatability, coherent zero offset and fabrication-scale error are distinct components requiring stated correlations before combination.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]},{"id":"b257-v15-33-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：模型讀值誤差很小所以換算回原型後可以完全忽略不計。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A small model reading error can be ignored completely after conversion to prototype scale. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「讀值誤差的放大」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Scaling measurement uncertainty\" is correct?","options":["模型的微小讀值誤差放回原型後也按相應比例放大，不能以數字小就忽略。","模型讀值誤差很小所以換算回原型後可以完全忽略不計。","重複三次結果很接近就代表所有未測工況與系統偏差都已驗證。"],"optionsEn":["Small model reading errors grow under prototype scaling and cannot be dismissed by their absolute size.","A small model reading error can be ignored completely after conversion to prototype scale.","Three closely agreeing repeats validate every untested condition and eliminate systematic bias."],"answer":0,"explanation":"模型的微小讀值誤差放回原型後也按相應比例放大，不能以數字小就忽略。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Small model reading errors grow under prototype scaling and cannot be dismissed by their absolute size. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":33},{"id":"b257-v15-34","title":"讀值誤差的放大：定量估算","titleEn":"Scaling measurement uncertainty: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"],"prerequisiteIds":["b257-v15-33"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「讀值誤差的放大」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Scaling measurement uncertainty” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設，非操作設定。假設模型水位標準不確定度0.0005m、λL=40且比例視為精確，原型相應標準不確定度0.020m；未含尺度本身誤差。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Assume model level standard uncertainty0.0005m and exact length ratio40. Prototype-equivalent uncertainty is0.020m, excluding uncertainty in the scale itself. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：分開估水位零偏、讀值散布及模型尺寸誤差，說明哪些為共同分量。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Estimate level bias, reading scatter and fabrication error separately, identifying shared components.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b257-v15-34-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設，非操作設定。假設模型水位標準不確定度0.0005m、λL=40且比例視為精確，原型相應標準不確定度0.020m；未含尺度本身誤差。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Assume model level standard uncertainty0.0005m and exact length ratio40. Prototype-equivalent uncertainty is0.020m, excluding uncertainty in the scale itself.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]},{"id":"b257-v15-34-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「讀值誤差的放大」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Scaling measurement uncertainty\", which statement holds?","options":["佛祿相似要求速度與模型長度使用完全相同的縮小倍數。","原創教學假設，非操作設定。","只要事後修改時間軸就能補救試驗時未縮尺的閥門動作。"],"optionsEn":["Froude similarity requires velocity to use exactly the same reduction factor as length.","Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings.","Rescaling the recorded time axis repairs any valve motion that was not correctly scaled during the test."],"answer":1,"explanation":"原創教學假設，非操作設定。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":34},{"id":"b257-v15-35","title":"讀值誤差的放大：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Scaling measurement uncertainty: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"],"prerequisiteIds":["b257-v15-34"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「讀值誤差的放大」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Scaling measurement uncertainty” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"分開估水位零偏、讀值散布及模型尺寸誤差，說明哪些為共同分量。以獨立控制點檢核高程，將量測及尺度不確定度傳播到原型結果，按有效精度四捨五入，不使用無依據的小數位。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Estimate level bias, reading scatter and fabrication error separately, identifying shared components. Check elevations against independent control, propagate measurement and scale uncertainty to prototype results and round to defensible precision rather than retaining unsupported decimal places. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：分開估水位零偏、讀值散布及模型尺寸誤差，說明哪些為共同分量。以獨立控制點檢核高程，將量測及尺度不確定度傳播到原型結果，按有效精度四捨五入，不使用無依據的小數位。","observationEn":"Site practice: Estimate level bias, reading scatter and fabrication error separately, identifying shared components. Check elevations against independent control, propagate measurement and scale uncertainty to prototype results and round to defensible precision rather than retaining unsupported decimal places.","failure":"注意干擾：水位零偏在所有測點共同存在時不會靠平均消失，尺度錯誤還可能同時影響水深和流量。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: A shared level offset survives averaging, and incorrect scale can affect both depth and discharge. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b257-v15-35-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"分開估水位零偏、讀值散布及模型尺寸誤差，說明哪些為共同分量。以獨立控制點檢核高程，將量測及尺度不確定度傳播到原型結果，按有效精度四捨五入，不使用無依據的小數位。","textEn":"Estimate level bias, reading scatter and fabrication error separately, identifying shared components. Check elevations against independent control, propagate measurement and scale uncertainty to prototype results and round to defensible precision rather than retaining unsupported decimal places.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]},{"id":"b257-v15-35-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"分開估水位零偏、讀值散布及模型尺寸誤差，說明哪些為共同分量。以獨立控制點檢核高程，將量測及尺度不確定度傳播到原型結果，按有效精度四捨五入，不使用無依據的小數位。","textEn":"Estimate level bias, reading scatter and fabrication error separately, identifying shared components. Check elevations against independent control, propagate measurement and scale uncertainty to prototype results and round to defensible precision rather than retaining unsupported decimal places.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「讀值誤差的放大」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Scaling measurement uncertainty\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","縮尺合力只需要跟長度成正比而不必考慮受壓面積。","分開估水位零偏、讀值散布及模型尺寸誤差，說明哪些為共同分量。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","Model force scales only linearly with length and does not depend on loaded area.","Estimate level bias, reading scatter and fabrication error separately, identifying shared components."],"answer":2,"explanation":"分開估水位零偏、讀值散布及模型尺寸誤差，說明哪些為共同分量。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Estimate level bias, reading scatter and fabrication error separately, identifying shared components. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":35},{"id":"b257-v15-36","title":"讀值誤差的放大：失效診斷","titleEn":"Scaling measurement uncertainty: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"],"prerequisiteIds":["b257-v15-35"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「讀值誤差的放大」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Scaling measurement uncertainty” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"水位零偏在所有測點共同存在時不會靠平均消失，尺度錯誤還可能同時影響水深和流量。只放大平均讀值而不放大誤差，會讓原型推估看起來過度精確。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"A shared level offset survives averaging, and incorrect scale can affect both depth and discharge. Scaling the mean reading without its uncertainty makes the inferred prototype result appear more precise than the experiment actually supports. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設模型水位標準不確定度0.0005m、λL=40且比例視為精確，原型相應標準不確定度0.020m；未含尺度本身誤差。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Prototype-equivalent uncertainty is0.020m, excluding uncertainty in the scale itself.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「模型讀值誤差很小所以換算回原型後可以完全忽略不計。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A small model reading error can be ignored completely after conversion to prototype scale.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b257-v15-36-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"水位零偏在所有測點共同存在時不會靠平均消失，尺度錯誤還可能同時影響水深和流量。只放大平均讀值而不放大誤差，會讓原型推估看起來過度精確。","textEn":"A shared level offset survives averaging, and incorrect scale can affect both depth and discharge. Scaling the mean reading without its uncertainty makes the inferred prototype result appear more precise than the experiment actually supports.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]},{"id":"b257-v15-36-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「讀值誤差的放大」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Scaling measurement uncertainty\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["水位零偏在所有測點共同存在時不會靠平均消失，尺度錯誤還可能同時影響水深和流量。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","重複三次結果很接近就代表所有未測工況與系統偏差都已驗證。"],"optionsEn":["A shared level offset survives averaging, and incorrect scale can affect both depth and discharge.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","Three closely agreeing repeats validate every untested condition and eliminate systematic bias."],"answer":0,"explanation":"水位零偏在所有測點共同存在時不會靠平均消失，尺度錯誤還可能同時影響水深和流量。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A shared level offset survives averaging, and incorrect scale can affect both depth and discharge. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":36},{"id":"b257-v15-37","title":"重複試驗與代表性：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Replicates and representativeness: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"],"prerequisiteIds":["b257-v15-36"],"objective":"說明「重複試驗與代表性」如何影響水力模型縮尺試驗的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Replicates and representativeness” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Scale-model testing of hydraulic structures”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"重複試驗能估計同條件下的散布，但三次重複不能涵蓋未測水位、流量或邊界狀態。平均值標準誤與單次觀測標準差用途不同，獨立性也需要重新建立初始條件；若同一零點偏差持續存在，增加次數只會讓錯誤平均顯得更穩定。 假設獨立流量結果0.098、0.100、0.102m³/s，平均0.100、樣本標準差0.002m³/s，變異係數2%；非全部工況不確定度。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「重複試驗與代表性」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Replicates estimate scatter under one condition but do not cover untested levels, discharges or boundaries. Standard error of a mean differs from the deviation of individual observations, and independence requires reestablishing initial conditions. A persistent zero bias is not reduced by replication; more runs can merely make the wrong mean appear increasingly stable and convincing. Assume independent discharges0.098,0.100,0.102m³/s. Mean0.100 and sample deviation0.002m³/s give2% coefficient of variation, not uncertainty for all operating conditions. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Replicates and representativeness” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設，非操作設定。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings.","failure":"常見誤解：「重複三次結果很接近就代表所有未測工況與系統偏差都已驗證。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Three closely agreeing repeats validate every untested condition and eliminate systematic bias.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「重複試驗與代表性」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Replicates and representativeness”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b257-v15-37-k1","title":"重複試驗與代表性","titleEn":"Replicates and representativeness","text":"重複試驗能估計同條件下的散布，但三次重複不能涵蓋未測水位、流量或邊界狀態。平均值標準誤與單次觀測標準差用途不同，獨立性也需要重新建立初始條件；若同一零點偏差持續存在，增加次數只會讓錯誤平均顯得更穩定。","textEn":"Replicates estimate scatter under one condition but do not cover untested levels, discharges or boundaries. Standard error of a mean differs from the deviation of individual observations, and independence requires reestablishing initial conditions.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]},{"id":"b257-v15-37-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：重複三次結果很接近就代表所有未測工況與系統偏差都已驗證。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Three closely agreeing repeats validate every untested condition and eliminate systematic bias. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「重複試驗與代表性」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Replicates and representativeness\" is correct?","options":["重複三次結果很接近就代表所有未測工況與系統偏差都已驗證。","重複試驗能估計同條件下的散布，但三次重複不能涵蓋未測水位、流量或邊界狀態。","只要模型外觀像原型就可以忽略局部縫隙與尺度方向差異。"],"optionsEn":["Three closely agreeing repeats validate every untested condition and eliminate systematic bias.","Replicates estimate scatter under one condition but do not cover untested levels, discharges or boundaries.","Visual similarity alone permits ignoring gaps and differences between horizontal and vertical scales."],"answer":1,"explanation":"重複試驗能估計同條件下的散布，但三次重複不能涵蓋未測水位、流量或邊界狀態。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Replicates estimate scatter under one condition but do not cover untested levels, discharges or boundaries. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":37},{"id":"b257-v15-38","title":"重複試驗與代表性：定量估算","titleEn":"Replicates and representativeness: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"],"prerequisiteIds":["b257-v15-37"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「重複試驗與代表性」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Replicates and representativeness” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設，非操作設定。假設獨立流量結果0.098、0.100、0.102m³/s，平均0.100、樣本標準差0.002m³/s，變異係數2%；非全部工況不確定度。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Assume independent discharges0.098,0.100,0.102m³/s. Mean0.100 and sample deviation0.002m³/s give2% coefficient of variation, not uncertainty for all operating conditions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：事先定義重複方式和回復初始水位程序，保留每次原始紀錄與共同校正資料。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Define repetition and initial-level restoration beforehand, retaining raw runs and shared calibration records.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b257-v15-38-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設，非操作設定。假設獨立流量結果0.098、0.100、0.102m³/s，平均0.100、樣本標準差0.002m³/s，變異係數2%；非全部工況不確定度。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Assume independent discharges0.098,0.100,0.102m³/s. Mean0.100 and sample deviation0.002m³/s give2% coefficient of variation, not uncertainty for all operating conditions.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]},{"id":"b257-v15-38-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「重複試驗與代表性」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Replicates and representativeness\", which statement holds?","options":["總流量與每米寬度流量在縮尺模型都使用同一比例次方。","重力壓力比例正確就表示空化與封閉氣泡壓縮也完全相似。","原創教學假設，非操作設定。"],"optionsEn":["Total discharge and discharge per unit width use the same scaling exponent.","Correct gravity-pressure scaling proves that cavitation and trapped-air compression are also fully similar.","Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings."],"answer":2,"explanation":"原創教學假設，非操作設定。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":38},{"id":"b257-v15-39","title":"重複試驗與代表性：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Replicates and representativeness: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"],"prerequisiteIds":["b257-v15-38"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「重複試驗與代表性」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Replicates and representativeness” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"事先定義重複方式和回復初始水位程序，保留每次原始紀錄與共同校正資料。用樣本而非母體分母計標準差，另列未試工況矩陣，避免以少量重複的低散布宣稱整個模型已驗證。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Define repetition and initial-level restoration beforehand, retaining raw runs and shared calibration records. Use the sample-deviation denominator and list the untested condition matrix separately, without interpreting low scatter from a few replicates as complete validation of the model domain. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：事先定義重複方式和回復初始水位程序，保留每次原始紀錄與共同校正資料。用樣本而非母體分母計標準差，另列未試工況矩陣，避免以少量重複的低散布宣稱整個模型已驗證。","observationEn":"Site practice: Define repetition and initial-level restoration beforehand, retaining raw runs and shared calibration records. Use the sample-deviation denominator and list the untested condition matrix separately, without interpreting low scatter from a few replicates as complete validation of the model domain.","failure":"注意干擾：三次都受同一流量計偏差時仍可非常一致，卻系統性偏離真值。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Three runs sharing one meter bias can agree closely while all miss the true value. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b257-v15-39-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"事先定義重複方式和回復初始水位程序，保留每次原始紀錄與共同校正資料。用樣本而非母體分母計標準差，另列未試工況矩陣，避免以少量重複的低散布宣稱整個模型已驗證。","textEn":"Define repetition and initial-level restoration beforehand, retaining raw runs and shared calibration records. Use the sample-deviation denominator and list the untested condition matrix separately, without interpreting low scatter from a few replicates as complete validation of the model domain.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]},{"id":"b257-v15-39-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"事先定義重複方式和回復初始水位程序，保留每次原始紀錄與共同校正資料。用樣本而非母體分母計標準差，另列未試工況矩陣，避免以少量重複的低散布宣稱整個模型已驗證。","textEn":"Define repetition and initial-level restoration beforehand, retaining raw runs and shared calibration records. Use the sample-deviation denominator and list the untested condition matrix separately, without interpreting low scatter from a few replicates as complete validation of the model domain.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「重複試驗與代表性」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Replicates and representativeness\"?","options":["事先定義重複方式和回復初始水位程序，保留每次原始紀錄與共同校正資料。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","模型主流雷諾數高就可以證明每個細縫和近壁區都與原型相似。"],"optionsEn":["Define repetition and initial-level restoration beforehand, retaining raw runs and shared calibration records.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","A high main-flow Reynolds number proves similarity in every small gap and near-wall region."],"answer":0,"explanation":"事先定義重複方式和回復初始水位程序，保留每次原始紀錄與共同校正資料。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Define repetition and initial-level restoration beforehand, retaining raw runs and shared calibration records. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":39},{"id":"b257-v15-40","title":"重複試驗與代表性：失效診斷","titleEn":"Replicates and representativeness: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"],"prerequisiteIds":["b257-v15-39"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「重複試驗與代表性」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Replicates and representativeness” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"三次都受同一流量計偏差時仍可非常一致，卻系統性偏離真值。挑掉不喜歡的試驗又會縮小散布，若沒有預定排除規則，所謂重複性可能只反映選擇性報告。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Three runs sharing one meter bias can agree closely while all miss the true value. Selective deletion shrinks scatter further, and without predefined exclusion criteria apparent repeatability may reflect reporting choices rather than reliable experimental behavior. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設獨立流量結果0.098、0.100、0.102m³/s，平均0.100、樣本標準差0.002m³/s，變異係數2%；非全部工況不確定度。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Mean0.100 and sample deviation0.002m³/s give2% coefficient of variation, not uncertainty for all operating conditions.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「重複三次結果很接近就代表所有未測工況與系統偏差都已驗證。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Three closely agreeing repeats validate every untested condition and eliminate systematic bias.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b257-v15-40-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"三次都受同一流量計偏差時仍可非常一致，卻系統性偏離真值。挑掉不喜歡的試驗又會縮小散布，若沒有預定排除規則，所謂重複性可能只反映選擇性報告。","textEn":"Three runs sharing one meter bias can agree closely while all miss the true value. Selective deletion shrinks scatter further, and without predefined exclusion criteria apparent repeatability may reflect reporting choices rather than reliable experimental behavior.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]},{"id":"b257-v15-40-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「重複試驗與代表性」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Replicates and representativeness\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","三次都受同一流量計偏差時仍可非常一致，卻系統性偏離真值。","只要模型外觀像原型就可以忽略局部縫隙與尺度方向差異。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Three runs sharing one meter bias can agree closely while all miss the true value.","Visual similarity alone permits ignoring gaps and differences between horizontal and vertical scales."],"answer":1,"explanation":"三次都受同一流量計偏差時仍可非常一致，卻系統性偏離真值。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Three runs sharing one meter bias can agree closely while all miss the true value. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":40}],"order":5}],"sourceIds":["v15s-hydraulic-lab","v15s-froude-manual","v15s-lab-projects","v15s-deltares-model"],"curriculumVersion":15,"stepCount":40,"estimatedMinutes":1000}};
